| ✅ Done? | Item |
|--------|------|
| ☐ | Replace `map.loadImage(url, cb)` with the promise version (`await` or `.then`). |
| ☐ | Call the image-loading code **inside** `map.on('load')` (or `style.load`). |
| ☐ | Verify the image URL is reachable, served over HTTPS, and has `Access-Control-Allow-Origin:*`. |
| ☐ | Ensure the name you pass to `addImage` (`'pin'` in the example) exactly matches the `icon-image` value in the symbol layer. |
| ☐ | If you’re using a custom style, make sure the style’s `sprite` and `glyphs` URLs are also non-Mapbox (e.g., OpenFreeMap or your own host). |
| ☐ | Open the browser console → “Network” tab → confirm the image request returns **200** and not a 401/403. |

